# # /formal-companion/
#
# Permanent identifiers for the formal-companion annotation format: one JSON
# document per Lean formalisation of a book, lecture notes or a paper, saying
# which Lean declarations formalise which items of the source and where those
# items sit in it.
# Source: https://github.com/mathlib-initiative/formal-companion-annotations
#
#   https://w3id.org/formal-companion/annotations/v<major>.<minor>/schema.json
#     -> the JSON Schema of that version of the format (a released schema file
#        never changes)
#   https://w3id.org/formal-companion/annotations -> the format's repository
#   https://w3id.org/formal-companion             -> the format's repository
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Jack McCarthy
# GitHub username: Deicyde

Options +FollowSymLinks
RewriteEngine on

RewriteRule ^annotations/v([0-9]+)\.([0-9]+)/schema\.json$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mathlib-initiative/formal-companion-annotations/main/schema/annotations-v$1.$2.schema.json [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^(annotations/?)?$ https://github.com/mathlib-initiative/formal-companion-annotations [R=302,L]
